/**
 * The example library — shared by the desktop workspace's Examples tab
 * (LibraryPanel) and the phone More sheet's Examples group.
 *
 *  - EXAMPLES: the four legacy example circuits (examples/*.json). Static
 *    imports (resolveJsonModule): they are small and the ERC / i18n tests
 *    read them directly. Their titles are English sources shown through t().
 *  - EMBEDDED_EXAMPLES: the curated project library in examples/embedded
 *    ('ohmlet-project' envelopes with the firmware embedded, generated by
 *    scripts/build-examples.mjs). Only the small metadata list (index.json,
 *    zh-TW content) is bundled; an example's envelope (~300 kB: layout +
 *    base64 ELF) is fetched as a static asset when it is opened.
 *  - LIBRARY: both as one list of LibraryExample, grouped by
 *    EXAMPLE_CATEGORIES order.
 *
 * Opening an example goes through lab.importProject (openLibraryExample) so
 * the embedded firmware is verified and bound to its board exactly like a
 * user's saved project; the legacy layouts go through the same path as bare
 * formatVersion-0 layouts. The list / text / search helpers are pure (the UI
 * passes its importProject in); openExampleById (UX contract K10) binds the
 * live stores. Node tests import this file freely.
 */
